      "text": "PK  = Primary Key (UUID)\nFK  = Database Foreign Key (Same Schema)\nref = Cross-Context Logical Ref (No FK)\n[UK]= Unique Constraint / Index\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500 Solid Line : Intra-Schema DB FK\n\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7 Dotted Line: Cross-Schema Logical Ref\n- - Dashed Line: Semantic Vector Search\n\n\ud83d\udfe1 Central Registry Entity\n\ud83d\udfe0 Orchestration Pipeline Runner\n\ud83d\udd35 Assessment Snapshots & Verdicts\n\ud83d\udfe2 Care Advice & 3NF Normalized Actions\n\ud83d\udfe3 Character Companion Persona\n\ud83d\udd2e pgvector Care RAG Knowledge Store",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PK  = Primary Key (UUID)\nFK  = Database Foreign Key (Same Schema)\nref = Cross-Context Logical Ref (No FK)\n[UK]= Unique Constraint / Index\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500 Solid Line : Intra-Schema DB FK\n\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7 Dotted Line: Cross-Schema Logical Ref\n- - Dashed Line: Semantic Vector Search\n\n\ud83d\udfe1 Central Registry Entity\n\ud83d\udfe0 Orchestration Pipeline Runner\n\ud83d\udd35 Assessment Snapshots & Verdicts\n\ud83d\udfe2 Care Advice & 3NF Normalized Actions\n\ud83d\udfe3 Character Companion Persona\n\ud83d\udd2e pgvector Care RAG Knowledge Store",
